<title>CANADA: Saskatchewan Wheat Pool details harvest progress.</title>
<headline>Saskatchewan Wheat Pool details harvest progress.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saskatchewan Wheat Pool on Wednesday detailed the level of harvest progress to Sept 16.</p>
<p>CROP     SWATHED (PCT)  COMBINED (PCT)</p>
<p>	   1996 91/95 Avg 1996 91/95 Avg</p>
<p>S.Wheat   44   33	  41   52</p>
<p>Durum     38   29	  40   53</p>
<p>Oats	41   38	  32   45</p>
<p>Barley    40   29	  45   62</p>
<p>Canola    49   42	  41   55</p>
<p>Flax	31   22	   5   17</p>
<p>Peas	21   17	  60   62</p>
<p>W.Wheat   10    6	  90   93</p>
<p>Rye	  3    2	  97   98</p>
<p>-- Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548</p>
</text>
